qishu-054-recluses-complete:p063","text":"　　京產少恬靜，閉意榮宦。頗涉文義，專修黃老。會稽孔覬，清剛有峻節，一見而爲款交。郡召主簿，州辟從事，稱疾去。除奉朝請，不就。與同郡顧歡同契，始寧東山開舍授學。建元中，武陵王曄爲會稽，太祖遣儒士劉瓛入東爲曄講說，京產請瓛至山舍講書，傾資供待，子栖躬自屣履，爲瓛生徒下食，其禮賢如此。孔稚珪、周顒、謝蘥竝致書以通殷懃。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":162,"last_line":162,"raw_start":8495,"raw_end":8653,"raw_character_offsets":[8495,8496,8497,8498,8499,8500,8501,8502,8503,8504,8505,8506,8507,8508,8509,8510,8511,8512,8513,8514,8515,8516,8517,8518,8519,8520,8521,8522,8523,8524,8525,8526,8527,8528,8529,8530,8531,8532,8533,8534,8535,8536,8537,8538,8539,8540,8541,8542,8543,8544,8545,8546,8547,8548,8549,8550,8551,8552,8553,8554,8555,8556,8557,8558,8559,8560,8561,8562,8563,8564,8565,8566,8567,8568,8569,8570,8571,8572,8573,8574,8575,8576,8577,8578,8579,8580,8581,8582,8583,8584,8585,8586,8587,8588,8589,8590,8591,8592,8593,8594,8595,8596,8597,8598,8599,8600,8601,8602,8603,8604,8605,8606,8607,8608,8609,8610,8611,8612,8613,8614,8615,8616,8617,8618,8619,8620,8621,8622,8623,8624,8625,8626,8627,8628,8629,8630,8631,8632,8633,8634,8635,8636,8637,8638,8639,8640,8641,8642,8643,8644,8645,8646,8647,8648,8649,8650,8651,8652],"revision_id":1762878},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"京產","kind":"person","person_id":"cx3_7fo_lvx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"孔覬","kind":"person","person_id":"vjg_m4c_ev5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"顧歡","kind":"person","person_id":"bn8_cdi_hv9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"劉瓛","kind":"person","person_id":"u3v_bez_ebk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"京產","kind":"person","person_id":"cx3_7fo_lvx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"瓛","kind":"person","person_id":"u3v_bez_ebk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0122","start":122,"end":123,"surface":"栖","kind":"person","person_id":"qil_xxj_ujk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0129","start":129,"end":130,"surface":"瓛","kind":"person","person_id":"u3v_bez_ebk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0141","start":141,"end":144,"surface":"孔稚珪","kind":"person","person_id":"z6r_wtu_wuj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p063:m0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"周顒","kind":"person","person_id":"vkd_5ff_i23","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-054","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p075","text":"　　吳苞字天蓋，濮陽鄄城人也。儒學，善《三禮》及《老》、《莊》。宋泰始中，過江聚徒教學。冠黃葛巾，竹麈尾，蔬食二十餘年。隆昌元年，詔曰：「處士濮陽吳苞，栖志穹谷，秉操貞固，沈情味古，白首彌厲。徵太學博士。」不就。始安王遙光、右衞江祏於蔣山南爲立館，自劉瓛卒後，學者咸歸之。以壽終。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":190,"last_line":190,"raw_start":9896,"raw_end":10036,"raw_character_offsets":[9896,9897,9898,9899,9900,9901,9902,9903,9904,9905,9906,9907,9908,9909,9910,9911,9912,9913,9914,9915,9916,9917,9918,9919,9920,9921,9922,9923,9924,9925,9926,9927,9928,9929,9930,9931,9932,9933,9934,9935,9936,9937,9938,9939,9940,9941,9942,9943,9944,9945,9946,9947,9948,9949,9950,9951,9952,9953,9954,9955,9956,9957,9958,9959,9960,9961,9962,9963,9964,9965,9966,9967,9968,9969,9970,9971,9972,9973,9974,9975,9976,9977,9978,9979,9980,9981,9982,9983,9984,9985,9986,9987,9988,9989,9990,9991,9992,9993,9994,9995,9996,9997,9998,9999,10000,10001,10002,10003,10004,10005,10006,10007,10008,10009,10010,10011,10012,10013,10014,10015,10016,10017,10018,10019,10020,10021,10022,10023,10024,10025,10026,10027,10028,10029,10030,10031,10032,10033,10034,10035],"revision_id":1762878},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p075:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"吳苞","kind":"person","person_id":"1oa_h3m_qqz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p075:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"天蓋","kind":"person","person_id":"1oa_h3m_qqz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p075:m0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"吳苞","kind":"person","person_id":"1oa_h3m_qqz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p075:m0106","start":106,"end":111,"surface":"始安王遙光","kind":"person","person_id":"98q_mll_d6v_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p075:m0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"江祏","kind":"person","person_id":"q63_4br_3of_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p075:m0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"劉瓛","kind":"person","person_id":"u3v_bez_ebk","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-054","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"},{"id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p003","text":"雅好博古，善老、莊，不尚繁華。工草隸，善鼓琴，亭然獨立，不交當世。沛國劉瓛聞風而悅，上書薦之。爲著作佐郎，遷司空祭酒，謝病不與公卿遊。齊高帝謂王儉曰：「卿從可謂朝隱。」答曰：「臣從非敢妄同高人，直是愛閑多病耳。」經贈儉詩云：「汝家在市門，我家在南郭；汝家饒賓侶，我家多鳥雀。」儉時聲高一代，賓客填門，僧佑不爲之屈，時人嘉之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":35,"end":37,"surface":"劉瓛","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p003:m0035","person_id":"u3v_bez_ebk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作瓛。"},{"start":71,"end":73,"surface":"王儉","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p003:m0071","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作儉。"},{"start":108,"end":109,"surface":"儉","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p003:m0108","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作儉。"},{"start":138,"end":139,"surface":"儉","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p003:m0138","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作儉。"},{"start":150,"end":152,"surface":"僧佑","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou:p003:m0150","person_id":"p93_tgr_t8r_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作佑。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":1752646,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":5781,"raw_end":5947,"raw_character_offsets":[5781,5782,5783,5784,5785,5786,5787,5788,5789,5790,5791,5792,5793,5794,5795,5796,5797,5798,5799,5800,5801,5802,5803,5804,5805,5806,5807,5808,5809,5810,5811,5812,5813,5814,5815,5816,5817,5818,5819,5820,5821,5822,5823,5824,5825,5826,5827,5828,5829,5830,5831,5832,5833,5834,5835,5836,5837,5838,5839,5840,5841,5842,5843,5844,5845,5846,5847,5848,5849,5850,5851,5852,5853,5854,5855,5856,5857,5858,5859,5860,5861,5862,5863,5864,5865,5866,5867,5868,5869,5870,5871,5872,5873,5874,5875,5876,5877,5878,5879,5880,5881,5882,5883,5884,5885,5886,5887,5888,5889,5890,5893,5896,5897,5898,5899,5900,5901,5902,5903,5904,5905,5906,5907,5908,5909,5910,5911,5912,5913,5914,5915,5916,5917,5918,5919,5920,5921,5922,5923,5924,5925,5926,5927,5928,5929,5930,5931,5932,5933,5934,5935,5936,5937,5938,5939,5940,5941,5942,5943,5944,5945,5946],"projection_sha256":"e5ea013f954d7f83c5d908f1604402f133b4a4ca60960958046d5c1be33d96af"},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangsengyou","book_id":"b-nanshi-021","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-021-wangsengyou-ws1752646"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","work_id":"w